    "highlights": [
      "Cross-platform: ps1/sh parity for all scripts, CRLF defense, UTF-8 forced encoding, Windows mcp_wrapper.py as native stdio path.",
      "HTTP/SSE auth is fail-closed: protected endpoints return 401 without a valid MCPAPIKEY.",
      "Docker: deployment locks, runtime env injection (opt-in), loopback → host.docker.internal auto-rewrite, NFS/CIFS/SMB mount rejection.",
      "SSE Hardening: per-principal rate limiting (429 + Retry-After), idle watchdog, trusted proxy CIDR allowlist, graceful shutdown draining, loopback port auto-fallback."
    ],
    "summary_zh_native": "Memory Palace 为 LLM Agent 提供持久化、可检索、可审计的外部记忆，让每次对话都能在之前的基础上继续，而不是从零开始。",
    "highlights_zh": [
      "HTTP/SSE 鉴权默认 fail-closed：未配置或未提供有效 MCPAPIKEY 时返回 401；stdio 不受影响。",
      "Docker 一键部署在服务端代理转发鉴权头，浏览器不会直接拿到真实 key。",
      "Docker 数据保存在 named volume data 和 snapshots 中。",
      "Forgetting Engine：运行时活力值按 VITALITYDECAYHALFLIFEDAYS 衰减（.env.example 中为 30 天）。"
    ],
